  "arduino": "// Mega has 54 digital pins and 16 ADC inputs. This uses D22..25 and A15.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  for (int pin = 22; pin <= 25; pin++) pinMode(pin, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(LED_BUILTIN, OUTPUT);\n}\nvoid loop() {\n  int value = analogRead(A15);\n  int bars = map(value, 0, 1023, 0, 4);\n  for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) digitalWrite(22 + i, i < bars);\n  digitalWrite(LED_BUILTIN, (millis() / 500) % 2);\n  Serial.println(value);\n  delay(80);\n}\n",
